{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……爱理，还好吗？”", "text_idx": 218, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 265, "voice": "sk0630", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“抱歉，谢谢你……感觉还可以……”", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 268, "voice": "ar3066", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──爱理的身体状况一个晚上没办法完全恢复。", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那、那就开始了……把答案卷翻过来。”", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "万智", "alt_speaker_idx": 250, "voice": "mc0148", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……唔唔。”", "text_idx": 216, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 268, "voice": "ar3067", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她还是来学校了。", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这件事我实在无法阻止她。", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她咬着牙也要参加考试。", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“小爱理，这个对感冒很有效喔。喝得下的话就喝吧……”", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 273, "voice": "mu0288", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“谢谢你……”", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 268, "voice": "ar3068", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯嗯，今天也很努力呢。明明应该躺下休息的才对……”", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 273, "voice": "mu0289", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "没有充分休息，感冒当然无法痊愈。", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "身体一直是虚弱的状态。", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……你那样没问题吗？爱理。”", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 271, "voice": "sn0196", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“刚才的文法怎么样？”", "text_idx": 219, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": "ht0229", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊……刚才是考文法啊……”", "text_idx": 224, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 268, "voice": "ar3069", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“喂喂……”", "text_idx": 225, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 271, "voice": "sn0197", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为身体不舒服，她没办法认真考试，完全无法发挥实力。", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是，她还是考完全部的科目──", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好，请把答案卷交上来。”", "text_idx": 231, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "万智", "alt_speaker_idx": 250, "voice": "mc0149", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 268, "voice": "ar3070", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔唔。”", "text_idx": 223, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 268, "voice": "ar3071", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "结束后，爱理精疲力尽地趴在桌上。", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“新吾同学，暂时麻烦你一个人扶一下了，爱理同学，跟你借钥匙喔……”", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 258, "voice": "ag0571", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“爱理、爱理，再撑一下下。”", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 265, "voice": "sk0631", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呼……”", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 263, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这样终于可以休息了……”", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 258, "voice": "ag0572", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我跟安洁扶着爱理回到她家。", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "樱乃和天羽学姐也因为担心而一起来。", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“购物麻烦纱凪去了……”", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 273, "voice": "mu0290", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，小爱理，把制服换下来吧？顺便擦拭一下身体喔。”", "text_idx": 227, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 273, "voice": "mu0291", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“安洁立刻去准备！”", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 258, "voice": "ag0573", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哥哥。”", "text_idx": 221, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 265, "voice": "sk0632", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，总之先换衣服……”", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 263, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在樱乃的眼神示意下，我打开衣柜拿出爱理的便服。", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这套可以吗？来。”", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 263, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我把衣服递给学姐，大家不知道为什么都脸红了。", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯？那个，不对吗？”", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 263, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……刚才是请你先出去一下的意思。”", "text_idx": 215, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 265, "voice": "sk0633", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“说、说的也是呢，瓜生君当然知道替换的衣服在哪里。”", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 273, "voice": "mu0292", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是说新吾同学的衣物也放在同样的地方呢。啊唔，这种不经意的刺激感……”", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 258, "voice": "ag0574", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……啊～”", "text_idx": 217, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 263, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "意识到此时的情况，我的脸也热了起来。", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是，我跟爱理的确是“那种关系”没有错。", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“总、总之，先帮她换衣服吧。”", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 263, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，说的也是。恋人在身边，小爱理也比较安心吧。”", "text_idx": 229, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 273, "voice": "mu0293", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……你能这么想真是太好了。”", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 263, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那小爱理，要扶你起来啰～”", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 273, "voice": "mu0294", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔……唔唔……不行……没办法、没办法……”", "text_idx": 222, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 268, "voice": "ar3072", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这样下、去……唔、唔唔、结果……”", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 268, "voice": "ar3073", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大家面面相觑。", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "爱理在梦中也在考试吗？一直呓语着没办法没办法……", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
